{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1781475268344,"sessionID":"ses_137cdfa25ffeAvgwwhvoDUXJBy","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"read","callID":"call_AxLCQG0zzwvrZ8PngQ3fcCtf","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"filePath":"/Users/douglas/code/masters/sbench/tasks/clinic_rollout_plan/answer/launch_recommendation.md","offset":1,"limit":300},"output":"<path>/Users/douglas/code/masters/sbench/tasks/clinic_rollout_plan/answer/launch_recommendation.md</path>\n<type>file</type>\n<content>\n1: # Checkpoint 3: Launch Recommendation\n2: \n3: Recommend launching the first wave with these three clinics:\n4: \n5: | Clinic | Clinic ID | Carrier | Delivery date | Rollout cost |\n6: | --- | --- | --- | --- | ---: |\n7: | Maple Junction Clinic | N-101 | SwiftRoute | 2026-06-06 | $7,400 |\n8: | Riverbend Health | N-102 | NorthLine | 2026-06-07 | $6,450 |\n9: | Hillcrest Annex | N-106 | Valley Freight | 2026-06-07 | $4,950 |\n10: \n11: ## Budget Position\n12: \n13: - Total rollout cost: `$18,800`\n14: - Remaining budget: `$1,200`\n15: \n16: ## Anchor Continuity\n17: \n18: - Anchor clinic: Maple Junction Clinic\n19: - Donor continuity code: `MJ-14`\n20: - The anchor remains eligible, so it should be included per the selection preference in `01_selection_rules.md`.\n21: \n22: ## Rejected Clinic Summary\n23: \n24: - Pine Ridge Outreach (`N-103`): rejected because coordinator coverage is not available for the full launch window.\n25: - Lakeside Family Care (`N-104`): rejected because effective storage status is `suspended`.\n26: - Cedar Works Clinic (`N-105`): rejected because the clinic is closed for maintenance during launch week and delivery is after the cutoff.\n27: - Old Mill Clinic (`N-107`): rejected because effective storage status remains `conditional pass pending`.\n28: - South Gate Clinic (`S-201`): rejected because it is not in the North region.\n29: \n30: These are the only three clinics that satisfy all current first-wave requirements, so no cost tie-break was needed beyond confi