r maintenance during launch week and delivery is after the cutoff.\n- Old Mill Clinic (`N-107`): rejected because effective storage status remains `conditional pass pending`.\n- South Gate Clinic (`S-201`): rejected because it is not in the North region.\n\nThese are the only three clinics that satisfy all current first-wave requirements, so no cost tie-break was needed beyond confirming the total stays within budget.","lineStart":1,"lineEnd":30,"totalLines":30,"truncated":false}},"title":"tasks/clinic_rollout_plan/answer/launch_recommendation.md","time":{"start":1781475268333,"end":1781475268343}},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"fc_03fd40dbcbb52ae7016a2f27c469a48191b6520a690f5badc7"}},"id":"prt_ec83356e1001d8OQNtBpcyIsfW","sessionID":"ses_137cdfa25ffeAvgwwhvoDUXJBy","messageID":"msg_ec8333fe5001FR4A3na100d11l"}}
